cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TRSpecAnalyzer: an app for the analysis of time-resolved spectroscopy data (MATLAB and Python versions)"
abstract: "An app for analyzing time-resolved spectroscopy data (transient absorption, time-resolved photoluminescence, time-resolved Raman and IR): corrections, single-wavelength fits, SVD, global and target analysis, lifetime density analysis, MCR-ALS and coherence analysis. The MATLAB version is a single file; it requires MATLAB R2020b or later and no additional toolboxes. A Python version with the same functions is included; it runs without MATLAB."
authors:
